    <property name="text">
     <string>miniCam8:
Because of hardware difference,different cameras' CFW slots will have different shift away from center,you can  set value in range 24~64,less or more than this range will make CFW shift to left or right too much.
Steps:
1.Ajust with Left and Right buttons;
2.Move CFW to any other solts and check if position is OK;
3.After finished,software will store this value and will setup again at next connection.</string>
